<script data-page="app" type="application/json">{"component":"flashcards\/study","props":{"errors":{},"name":"Topwords","auth":{"user":{"id":5,"name":"\u00c1rp\u00e1d Szaniszl\u00f3","email":"developedbybarley@gmail.com","email_verified_at":null,"two_factor_confirmed_at":null,"streak":11,"quiz_completions":1,"text_analyses":14,"last_activity_date":"2026-06-11T00:00:00.000000Z","onboarding_completed_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:25.000000Z","created_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-06-11T11:58:23.000000Z","stripe_id":"cus_UR8u0ziMkWwJIo","pm_type":null,"pm_last_four":null,"trial_ends_at":null,"ai_access":false,"subscriptions":[]},"isAdmin":true,"subscription":{"hasActiveAccess":true,"isSubscribed":false,"isPremium":false,"hasAiAccess":false,"isOnTrial":false}},"sidebarOpen":true,"flash":{"streakTriggered":null,"success":null,"achievements":[],"calibrationPrompt":null,"showTour":false,"importedCardId":null},"deck":{"id":10,"name":"Prev"},"cards":[{"id":51416,"front":"<p>The company decided to _______ a major new construction project, despite the economic uncertainty. <em>(elv\u00e1llal \/ belekezd)<\/em><\/p><p>He had to _______ a long and difficult journey to reach his destination. <em>(megtesz \/ v\u00e9grehajt)<\/em><\/p><p>The government will _______ a thorough investigation into the allegations of corruption. <em>(ind\u00edt \/ foganatos\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>Are you willing to _______ the responsibility for this decision? <em>(mag\u00e1ra v\u00e1llal \/ felv\u00e1llal)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">elv\u00e1llal \/ megtesz \/ belekezd<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elutas\u00edt \/ visszautas\u00edt \/ lemond<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a project = projektet elv\u00e1llal (pl. They will _______ a new research project next month.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a task = feladatot elv\u00e1llal\/v\u00e9grehajt (pl. It&#039;s a difficult task, but someone has to _______ it.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a journey = utat megtesz (pl. Explorers often _______ perilous journeys.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a responsibility = felel\u0151ss\u00e9get felv\u00e1llal (pl. He was reluctant to _______ such a huge responsibility.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ an investigation = vizsg\u00e1latot ind\u00edt\/lefolytat (pl. The police decided to _______ an immediate investigation.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>undertake<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>undertaking<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>undertake<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: undertake a project \/ undertake a task \/ undertake a journey \/ undertake responsibility<\/span><\/p><p>similar: commence \/ embark on \/ perform \/ assume<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: abandon \/ forego \/ decline<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"undertake","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":4,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-06","reviewed_on":"2026-06-10","due_at":"2026-06-10T20:41:34+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-09T21:13:03+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":4,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-06","reviewed_on":"2026-06-09"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"3 \u00f3ra","good":"6 \u00f3ra","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-10T18:12:18+00:00"},{"id":51427,"front":"<p>The police obtained an _______ for the suspect after gathering sufficient evidence. <em>(elfogat\u00f3parancs \/ letart\u00f3ztat\u00e1si parancs)<\/em><\/p><p>Without an _______, the authorities cannot legally detain the individual. <em>(letart\u00f3ztat\u00e1si parancs \/ hivatalos elfogat\u00f3parancs)<\/em><\/p><p>The judge issued an _______ following the grand jury&#039;s indictment. <em>(elfogat\u00f3parancsot \/ letart\u00f3ztat\u00e1si v\u00e9gz\u00e9st)<\/em><\/p><p>International cooperation is often required to execute an _______ for fugitives who have fled the country. <em>(elfogat\u00f3parancsot \/ letart\u00f3ztat\u00e1si parancsot)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">elfogat\u00f3parancs \/ letart\u00f3ztat\u00e1si parancs \/ k\u00f6r\u00f6z\u00e9s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): felment\u00e9s \/ szabadon bocs\u00e1t\u00e1s \/ mentess\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 issue an _______ = elfogat\u00f3parancsot kiad (pl. The judge will issue an _______ tomorrow.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 obtain an _______ = elfogat\u00f3parancsot szerez (pl. The detectives worked to obtain an _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 execute an _______ = elfogat\u00f3parancsot v\u00e9grehajt (pl. They were tasked to execute an _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 outstanding _______ = kiadatlan\/\u00e9rv\u00e9nyes elfogat\u00f3parancs (pl. There&#039;s an outstanding _______ for his arrest.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>arrest warrant<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>arrest warrant<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: issue an arrest warrant \/ obtain an arrest warrant \/ execute an arrest warrant \/ outstanding arrest warrant<\/span><\/p><p>similar: bench warrant \/ warrant of arrest \/ apprehension order<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: release order \/ acquittal \/ exoneration<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":4,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-08","reviewed_on":"2026-06-10","due_at":"2026-06-10T19:41:59+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-09T20:14:42+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":3,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-08","reviewed_on":"2026-06-09"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"3 \u00f3ra","good":"6 \u00f3ra","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-13T16:07:14+00:00"},{"id":51417,"front":"<p>The doctor examined the wound, noting that the infection had spread deep into the surrounding ______. <em>(h\u00fas \/ sz\u00f6vet)<\/em><\/p><p>In many cultures, abstaining from eating animal ______ is a spiritual practice. <em>(h\u00fas \/ \u00e1llati test)<\/em><\/p><p>The artist&#039;s sculpture depicted the human form with remarkable detail, capturing the subtle contours of bone and ______. <em>(test \/ testi anyag)<\/em><\/p><p>He felt a chill run through his ______ as he heard the strange noise from the attic. <em>(test \/ b\u0151r)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">h\u00fas \/ test \/ testi \u00e9lvezet<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): szellem \/ l\u00e9lek \/ szellemis\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 human _______ = emberi test\/h\u00fas (pl. The painting depicted the beauty of the human _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 animal _______ = \u00e1llati h\u00fas (pl. Many vegetarians avoid eating animal _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 put _______ on the bones = h\u00fast tesz a csontokra (\u00e1tvitt \u00e9rtelemben: r\u00e9szleteket ad, kib\u0151v\u00edt) (pl. The architect needed to put more _______ on the bones of the initial design.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 one&#039;s own _______ and blood = valakinek a saj\u00e1t h\u00fasa \u00e9s v\u00e9re (rokon, csal\u00e1dtag) (pl. He would do anything for his own _______ and blood.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>flesh<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>fleshy<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>flesh<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: human flesh \/ animal flesh \/ flesh and blood \/ bare flesh<\/span><\/p><p>similar: meat \/ body \/ skin \/ tissue<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: spirit \/ soul \/ mind<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"flesh\nfleshy","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-06","reviewed_on":"2026-06-09","due_at":"2026-06-11T10:09:22+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-08T08:08:54+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":2,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-06","reviewed_on":"2026-06-08"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"3 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-11T16:17:50+00:00"},{"id":51422,"front":"<p>Water began to _______ from the leaky faucet, forming a small puddle on the floor. <em>(sziv\u00e1rog \/ csepeg)<\/em><\/p><p>After the initial rush, donations started to _______ into the charity fund. <em>(lassan \u00e9rkezik \/ csordog\u00e1l)<\/em><\/p><p>The company&#039;s profits have been reduced to a mere _______ this quarter due to market downturns. <em>(csek\u00e9ly mennyis\u00e9g \/ kev\u00e9s bev\u00e9tel)<\/em><\/p><p>A _______ of sunlight managed to penetrate the dense canopy, illuminating a patch of moss. <em>(v\u00e9kony sug\u00e1r \/ kev\u00e9s f\u00e9ny)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">csordog\u00e1l \/ sziv\u00e1rog \/ csepeg \/ kev\u00e9s mennyis\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): \u00e1rad \/ \u00f6mlik \/ zubog<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a _______ of water = v\u00edzcsordog\u00e1l\u00e1s, v\u00edzcsepp (pl. A _______ of water was all that was left in the stream.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 money began to _______ in = lassan elkezdett befolyni a p\u00e9nz (pl. After the appeal, money began to _______ in slowly.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ out = kisziv\u00e1rog, kicsordog\u00e1l (pl. Information started to _______ out about the scandal.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ down = lecsordog\u00e1l, lefolyik (pl. Tears began to _______ down her cheeks.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>trickle<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>trickle<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>trickle<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: trickle down \/ trickle in \/ a trickle of \/ slow trickle<\/span><\/p><p>similar: drip \/ dribble \/ seep \/ ooze<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: gush \/ pour \/ flood<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"trickle","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":3,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-06","reviewed_on":"2026-06-10","due_at":"2026-06-10T19:12:09+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-09T20:46:17+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":3,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-06","reviewed_on":"2026-06-09"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"1.5 \u00f3ra","good":"2 \u00f3ra","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-11T16:38:26+00:00"},{"id":51421,"front":"<p>The protesters decided to _______ in front of the government building, refusing to move until their demands were heard. <em>(guggol \/ le\u00fcl)<\/em><\/p><p>Despite the impressive exterior, the building itself was a rather ugly, low, and _______ structure. <em>(alacsony \/ z\u00f6m\u00f6k)<\/em><\/p><p>During the military exercise, soldiers were trained to _______ quickly behind cover to avoid enemy fire. <em>(leguggol \/ elb\u00fajik)<\/em><\/p><p>The old woman owned a small, _______ cottage that seemed to huddle against the harsh winds of the coast. <em>(alacsony \/ kicsi \u00e9s z\u00f6m\u00f6k)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">guggol \/ leguggol \/ z\u00f6m\u00f6k \/ guggol\u00e1s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): fel\u00e1ll \/ magasodik \/ egyenesedik<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ down = leguggol (pl. He had to _______ down to pick up the dropped keys.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a _______ building = egy z\u00f6m\u00f6k \u00e9p\u00fclet (pl. The old factory was a rather _______ building.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ on one&#039;s heels = a sark\u00e1n guggol (pl. She would often _______ on her heels while waiting.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a _______ position = guggol\u00f3 poz\u00edci\u00f3 (pl. He took a _______ position behind the bush.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>squat<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>squat<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>squat<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>squat<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: squat down \/ squat thrust \/ squat building \/ squat position<\/span><\/p><p>similar: crouch \/ hunker \/ stocky \/ stumpy<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: stand \/ tall \/ erect<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"squat","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":5,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-06","reviewed_on":"2026-06-10","due_at":"2026-06-10T23:42:26+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-09T21:12:21+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":4,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-06","reviewed_on":"2026-06-09"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"9 \u00f3ra","good":"1 nap","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-11T10:09:31+00:00"},{"id":51418,"front":"<p>The company will _______ new employees into their training program next month. <em>(bevezet \/ felvesz)<\/em><\/p><p>After a long career, the legendary musician was finally chosen to be _______ into the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame. <em>(beiktat \/ felvesz a tagok k\u00f6z\u00e9)<\/em><\/p><p>The university plans to _______ a new system for online course registration. <em>(bevezet \/ elind\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>The secret society will _______ new members through a series of ancient rituals. <em>(felvesz \/ beavat)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">bevezet \/ felvesz \/ beiktat<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): kiz\u00e1r \/ elt\u00e1vol\u00edt \/ elutas\u00edt<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ someone into a position = valakit poz\u00edci\u00f3ba beiktat (pl. The president will _______ the new minister into his role next week.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ someone into a club\/organization = valakit klubba\/szervezetbe felvesz (pl. They decided to _______ several new members into the chess club.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a new system\/policy = \u00faj rendszert\/politik\u00e1t bevezet (pl. The government plans to _______ a new tax policy.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ someone into the military = valakit katonai szolg\u00e1latba bevon (pl. He was _______ into the army right after high school.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>induct<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>induction<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>induct<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: induct into \/ induct new members \/ induct a system \/ induct a policy<\/span><\/p><p>similar: admit \/ initiate \/ install \/ introduce<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: expel \/ exclude \/ reject<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"induct\ninduction","study_direction":"bac