. The bird began to _______ its wings.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>unfold<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>unfold<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: unfold a story \/ unfold a map \/ unfold a plan \/ unfold its wings<\/span><\/p><p>similar: open \/ spread \/ reveal \/ develop<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: fold \/ close \/ conceal<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"unfold","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":4,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-08","reviewed_on":"2026-06-10","due_at":"2026-06-10T19:42:05+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-09T20:13:42+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":3,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-08","reviewed_on":"2026-06-09"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"3 \u00f3ra","good":"6 \u00f3ra","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-11T22:07:34+00:00"},{"id":51430,"front":"<p>Excuse me, could you tell me where the nearest _______ is? <em>(mosd\u00f3 \/ WC)<\/em><\/p><p>The airplane&#039;s _______ was temporarily out of order during the flight. <em>(rep\u00fcl\u0151g\u00e9p mosd\u00f3ja \/ fed\u00e9lzeti WC)<\/em><\/p><p>Guests are kindly requested to keep the communal _______ clean and tidy. <em>(k\u00f6z\u00f6s mell\u00e9khelyis\u00e9g \/ k\u00f6z\u00f6s illemhely)<\/em><\/p><p>After a long journey, the first thing I looked for upon arrival was a clean and accessible _______. <em>(mell\u00e9khelyis\u00e9g \/ WC)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">mosd\u00f3 \/ WC \/ mell\u00e9khelyis\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): tisztas\u00e1g \/ higi\u00e9nia \/ rend<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 public _______ = nyilv\u00e1nos WC (pl. The city needs more clean public _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 airplane _______ = rep\u00fcl\u0151g\u00e9p WC-je (pl. The airplane _______ was occupied.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 men&#039;s _______ = f\u00e9rfi WC (pl. The sign pointed to the men&#039;s _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ladies&#039; _______ = n\u0151i WC (pl. She asked for directions to the ladies&#039; _______.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>lavatory<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>lavatory<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: public lavatory \/ airplane lavatory \/ men&#039;s lavatory \/ ladies&#039; lavatory<\/span><\/p><p>similar: toilet \/ restroom \/ washroom \/ WC<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: cleanliness \/ hygiene \/ order<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"lavatory","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":4,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-10","due_at":"2026-06-10T19:43:33+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-10T14:34:12+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":3,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-10"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"3 \u00f3ra","good":"6 \u00f3ra","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-11T18:09:25+00:00"},{"id":51439,"front":"<p>After sitting at the computer for hours, my neck felt incredibly _______. <em>(merev \/ f\u00e1jdalmasan mozdulatlan)<\/em><\/p><p>The company faced _______ competition in the market, making it difficult to gain market share. <em>(kem\u00e9ny \/ er\u0151s)<\/em><\/p><p>She gave him a _______ nod, indicating her disapproval without saying a word. <em>(rideg \/ tart\u00f3zkod\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>Despite the cold weather, the old man maintained a _______ upper lip, refusing to complain. <em>(