ompany&#039;s commitment to sustainability. <em>(megtestes\u00edt \/ kifejez)<\/em><\/p><p>She truly seems to _______ the spirit of adventure, always seeking new challenges. <em>(megtestes\u00edt \/ k\u00e9pvisel)<\/em><\/p><p>In his later works, the artist began to _______ more abstract concepts. <em>(megtestes\u00edt \/ form\u00e1ba \u00f6nt)<\/em><\/p><p>The ancient ruins _______ the rich history of the civilization that once thrived there. <em>(tan\u00faskodik \/ mag\u00e1ban foglal)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">megtestes\u00edt \/ kifejez \/ mag\u00e1ban foglal<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elhanyagol \/ mell\u0151z \/ tagad<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a principle = egy elvet megtestes\u00edt (pl. The new policy aims to embody a principle of fairness.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ the spirit of = valaminek a szellem\u00e9t megtestes\u00edti (pl. She truly embodies the spirit of generosity.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ an idea = egy \u00f6tletet megtestes\u00edt (pl. The sculpture was created to embody an idea of freedom.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ values = \u00e9rt\u00e9keket megtestes\u00edt (pl. The leader should embody the values of the community.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>embody<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>embodiment<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>embody<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: embody the spirit \/ embody a principle \/ embody an idea \/ embody values<\/span><\/p><p>similar: represent \/ manifest \/ personify \/ incarnate<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: disembody \/ neglect \/ exclude<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":2,"is_le