ovoke \/ thrill<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: calm \/ soothe \/ bore<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"excite","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":4,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-10","due_at":"2026-06-10T19:43:20+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-10T14:30:28+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":3,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-10"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"3 \u00f3ra","good":"6 \u00f3ra","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-11T22:08:03+00:00"},{"id":51435,"front":"<p>The news of the sudden factory closure caused considerable _______ among the employees. <em>(nyugtalans\u00e1got \/ aggodalmat)<\/em><\/p><p>A sense of _______ settled over the village after the mysterious disappearance. <em>(nyugtalans\u00e1g \/ zavarts\u00e1g)<\/em><\/p><p>His unusual silence began to _______ his parents, who were used to his constant chatter. <em>(nyugtalan\u00edtani \/ aggasztani)<\/em><\/p><p>The government&#039;s new policy on education has created widespread _______ in academic circles. <em>(el\u00e9gedetlens\u00e9get \/ aggodalmat)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">nyugtalans\u00e1g \/ aggodalom \/ zavar \/ nyugtalan\u00edt \/ aggaszt<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): nyugalom \/ b\u00e9ke \/ megnyugv\u00e1s<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 cause _______ = nyugtalans\u00e1got okoz (pl. The rumors caused widespread _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a sense of _______ = egyfajta nyugtalans\u00e1g (pl. A sense of _______ pervaded the room.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 feel _______ = nyugtalans\u00e1got \u00e9rez (pl. She began to feel _______ a